    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">The string <var>candies</var> represents a queue of candies, from first to last. Each digit represents one candy.<br><br>Repeat these steps until the queue is empty:<br><br>1. Eat and remove the <strong>first candy</strong>. This candy never returns to the queue. Record its digit for the output.<br>2. Perform as many moves as the value of the digit just eaten. Each move takes the <strong>first remaining candy</strong> and places that candy at the <strong>end of the queue</strong>. Skip this step if the queue is empty.<br><br>Print the recorded digits as a single string, in the order the candies were eaten.<br><br><strong>Example:</strong><br>For <var>candies</var> = <const>24135</const>:<br><br>Eat <const>2</const>. The remaining queue is <const>4135</const>.<br><br>Perform <const>2</const> moves:<br>- First move: place <const>4</const> at the end. The queue becomes <const>1354</const>.<br>- Second move: place <const>1</const> at the end. The queue becomes <const>3541</const>.<br><br>Next, eat <const>3</const>, then perform <const>3</const> moves on the remaining queue.<br><br>Continue until all candies are eaten. The output is <const>23514</const>.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> A string <var>candies</var> of digits.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> A string <var>eaten_order</var> containing the recorded digits in order.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><const>1</const> &lt;= length of <var>candies</var> &lt;= <const>50</const><br>Every digit of <var>candies</var> is between <const>1</const> and <const>9</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">24135</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">23514</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
